<title>BELGIUM: Kredietbank optional share dividend offer.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank optional share dividend offer.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Kredietbank said on Thursday it would give its shareholders a choice between receiving a 265 franc net dividend on 1996 earnings or subscribing to new shares.</p>
<p>Kredietbank said shareholders taking the optional stock dividend, could subscribe to one new reduced withholding tax VVPR shares for 42 coupons plus 11,130 francs in cash.</p>
<p>Subscriptions will run from May 12 to 26.</p>
<p>The maximum number of new shares which will be created is 351,000 for a maximum capital increase of 3.9 billion Belgian francs.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
